RaceName,waterkin//female,變體水靈
RaceName,waterkin//male,變體水靈
RaceName,waterkin//non-binary,變體水靈
SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells.",指向一名生物並化身為對方形態，複製其外形、屬性、技能與法術。
SpellDescription,"Crush foes with a heavy torrent of water focused on strength, dealing light damage while reliably knocking them back and stunning them.",以偏重力量的重水洪流衝擊目標，造成少量水系傷害並穩定擊退與眩暈敵人。
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",化作洶湧波浪向前閃爍突進，對周圍敵人造成水波範圍傷害，並短暫獲得穿牆與幻影閃避。
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,解除當前變形狀態，立即切回變體水靈本體。
SpellDescription,"Shift toward agility (converting 1 to 5 STR & CON into DEX per cast by mastery), freely repeatable and empowering permanent Ebb speed and dodge.",向敏捷轉換屬性（隨熟練度每次將 1~5 點力量與體質轉化為等額敏捷，可自由多次轉換），同時疊加常駐「潮落」移速與閃避。
SpellDescription,"Shift toward strength (converting 1 to 5 DEX into STR & CON per cast by mastery), freely repeatable while empowering permanent Flow slow resistance and life recovery and healing immediately.",向力量轉換屬性（隨熟練度每次將 1~5 點敏捷轉化為等額力量與體質，可自由多次轉換），同時疊加常駐「潮漲」抗減速與生命恢復並立即回血。
SpellDescription,"Unleash a razor-sharp surge of water focused on agility, dealing heavy burst water damage to enemies.",以偏重敏捷的鋒銳高壓水波轟擊目標，造成高額爆發水系傷害。
SpellName,adaptive strike agility,變體攻擊·敏捷
SpellName,adaptive strike strength,變體攻擊·力量
SpellName,morph,變形
SpellName,morph agility,屬性轉換·敏捷
SpellName,morph revert,解除變形
SpellName,morph strength,屬性轉換·力量
SpellName,waveform,波浪形態
